    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>We\u2019ve lost all contact</i></strong> with the research teams at the Ptolemy Moon Base. \u201c<i><strong>Help Us</strong></i>,\u201d was the last message received from them... That was two months ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is straight forward. Ring Transport to Ptolemy Moon Base. Collect and transport back samples of the new experimental spore drugs, then return to base through the Ring Transporter to give us your assessment of the moon base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Haunting of Ptolemy</strong></i>\u00a0is a first-person shooter\u00a0video game developed by\u00a03 Beams Studio. The game is played from a\u00a0first-person perspective\u00a0and all of its levels are navigated on foot. The story is arranged in chapters, which players complete in order to progress. The game features a variety of weapons, which will be needed for protection against some of the indigenous life forms.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>We\u2019ve lost all contact</i></strong> with the research teams at the Ptolemy Moon Base. \u201c<i><strong>Help Us</strong></i>,\u201d was the last message received from them... That was two months ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is straight forward. Ring Transport to Ptolemy Moon Base. Collect and transport back samples of the new experimental spore drugs, then return to base through the Ring Transporter to give us your assessment of the moon base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Haunting of Ptolemy</strong></i>\u00a0is a first-person shooter\u00a0video game developed by\u00a03 Beams Studio. The game is played from a\u00a0first-person perspective\u00a0and all of its levels are navigated on foot. The story is arranged in chapters, which players complete in order to progress. The game features a variety of weapons, which will be needed for protection against some of the indigenous life forms.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Haunting of Ptolemy\u00a0is a first-person shooter\u00a0game.\u00a0The game features a variety of weapons, which will be needed for protection against some of the indigenous life forms. Collect the spore samples, transport them back, outmaneuver the obstacles and traps, and above all, Stay Alive!",
